<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέρῐφ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερεός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>firm,
				solid</i>, of ground, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τοῦ ἕλους, ᾗ ἦν . . -ώτατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.101
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> s.h.v.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πρῴρας -ωτέρας ἐποίησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερίφοις . . τοῖς
			ἐμβόλοις</span> with their rams <i>made solid</i>, ibid.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέριφον, τό</span>, <i>rock-bottom,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1668.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1682.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεῖρα</span>
			 (B), <i>barren, unfruitful</i>, of women, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				641
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				149b
			</span></i>; of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				611a12
			</span></i>; of fruit, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.11.1
			</span></i>.</div>
